    <bpmn:process id="W_W38" name="W38. Special Order / Non-Stock Item Fulfillment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer requests an item not carried in regular store assortment
Frequency: ~3,000–5,000 special orders/month chain-wide; ~15–25 per store per month (one register with W1506)
Volume: Primarily professional trade customers (contractors, builders) and project-specific items; avg order value ~PHP 5,000–15,000
Owner: Customer Service Rep (order intake); Buyer (fulfillment)
Participants: CSR, Sales Rep (trade accounts), Buyer, Receiving Clerk, Customer
Source: workflow W38 — Special Order / Non-Stock Item Fulfillment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W38_LaneSet8">
        <bpmn:lane id="W38_Lane1" name="Customer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W38_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W38_Task15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W38_Start9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W38_Lane2" name="CSR">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W38_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W38_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W38_Task22</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W38_Task25</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W38_Lane3" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W38_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W38_Task16</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W38_Task20</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W38_Task24</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W38_Lane4" name="Buyer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W38_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W38_Task17</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W38_Task18</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W38_Lane5" name="Receiving Clerk">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W38_Task19</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W38_Lane6" name="Cashier">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W38_Task21</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W38_Lane7" name="Buyer + Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W38_Task23</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W38_End26</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W38_Start9" name="Customer requests an item not carried in regular store assortment">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W38_Flow29</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W38_Task10" name="Customer requests non-stock item at store (CSR counter) or via Sales Rep…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Customer requests non-stock item at store (CSR counter) or via Sales Rep; provides product description, specification, quantity needed, and desired delivery date
Responsible (R): Customer
Accountable (A): —
Duration: —</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W38_Flow29</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W38_Flow30</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W38_Task11" name="CSR or Sales Rep searches item in system: (a) checks if item exists in item…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: CSR or Sales Rep searches item in system: (a) checks if item exists in item master as non-stock/Special Order type, (b) if not found, creates a non-stock item request with description, specs, and estimated price
Responsible (R): CSR / Sales Rep
Accountable (A): Dept. Supervisor
Duration: 5–10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W38_Flow30</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W38_Flow31</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W38_Task12" name="System routes non-stock item creation request to Merchandise Planner for item…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: System routes non-stock item creation request to Merchandise Planner for item master setup (category assignment, unit of measure, tax classification)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Merchandise Planner
Duration: Automated routing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W38_Flow31</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W38_Flow32</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W38_Task13" name="Buyer identifies vendor, obtains quotation (price, lead time, minimum…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Buyer identifies vendor, obtains quotation (price, lead time, minimum quantity); enters quote in system linked to the non-stock SKU
Responsible (R): Buyer
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 30–60 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W38_Flow32</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W38_Flow33</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W38_Task14" name="CSR or Sales Rep communicates quote to customer: price, estimated delivery…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: CSR or Sales Rep communicates quote to customer: price, estimated delivery date, payment terms (typically 50% deposit, 50% on delivery)
Responsible (R): CSR / Sales Rep
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W38_Flow33</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W38_Flow34</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W38_Task15" name="Customer confirms order and pays deposit; system records deposit as liability…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Customer confirms order and pays deposit; system records deposit as liability (Cr. Customer Deposits Payable / Dr. Cash); not recognized as revenue until delivery
Responsible (R): Customer / Cashier
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W38_Flow34</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W38_Flow35</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W38_Task16" name="System creates Sales Order linked to non-stock SKU with customer deposit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: System creates Sales Order linked to non-stock SKU with customer deposit recorded; reservation created against incoming PO
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W38_Flow35</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W38_Flow36</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W38_Task17" name="Buyer creates Special Order PO (links PO to Sales Order); routes for approval…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Buyer creates Special Order PO (links PO to Sales Order); routes for approval per standard tiered matrix (W2)
Responsible (R): Buyer
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: Per W2</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W38_Flow36</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W38_Flow37</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W38_Task18" name="Buyer tracks PO; follows up with vendor on delivery schedule">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 9: Buyer tracks PO; follows up with vendor on delivery schedule
Responsible (R): Buyer
Accountable (A): Buyer
Duration: Per W2</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W38_Flow37</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W38_Flow38</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W38_Task19" name="Goods received at store or DC (per W3 or W18); system matches GR to both PO and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 10: Goods received at store or DC (per W3 or W18); system matches GR to both PO and linked Sales Order
Responsible (R): Receiving Clerk
Accountable (A): Dept. Supervisor
Duration: Per W3/W18</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W38_Flow38</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W38_Flow39</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W38_Task20" name="System alerts CSR that special order has arrived; CSR contacts customer for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 11: System alerts CSR that special order has arrived; CSR contacts customer for pickup or arranges delivery
Responsible (R): System / CSR
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Automated + 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W38_Flow39</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W38_Flow40</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W38_Task21" name="Customer picks up item (or receives delivery); pays remaining balance; system…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 12: Customer picks up item (or receives delivery); pays remaining balance; system recognizes revenue (Dr. Customer Deposits / Cr. Revenue) and COGS (Dr. COGS / Cr. Inventory) at delivery; Sales Order closed
Responsible (R): Cashier / CSR
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W38_Flow40</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W38_Flow41</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W38_Task22" name="If customer cancels before PO is placed: CSR cancels Sales Order; deposit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 13: If customer cancels before PO is placed: CSR cancels Sales Order; deposit refunded; no PO created
Responsible (R): CSR
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W38_Flow41</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W38_Flow42</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W38_Task23" name="If customer cancels after PO is placed but before shipment: Buyer negotiates…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 14: If customer cancels after PO is placed but before shipment: Buyer negotiates with vendor (restocking fee, return); Finance processes partial refund less any costs
Responsible (R): Buyer + Finance
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W38_Flow42</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W38_Flow43</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W38_Task24" name="Unclaimed deposit management: system tracks age of customer deposits linked to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 15: Unclaimed deposit management: system tracks age of customer deposits linked to completed special orders (goods received but not picked up); after 30 days with no customer response post-delivery notification, system sends reminder notification (SMS/email); after 90 days with no response, system flags deposit for review; Store Manager or Finance approves recognition of abandoned deposit as other income (Dr. Customer Deposits Payable / Cr. Other Income); goods dispositioned per standard clearance (W13.9a), RTV (W3.6a), or return to shelf
Responsible (R): System / Store Manager / Finance
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Automated + 5 min/review</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W38_Flow43</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W38_Flow44</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W38_Task25" name="Customer deposit refund (before goods receipt)">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 16: Customer deposit refund (before goods receipt): if customer requests cancellation and refund before goods are received from vendor — (a) CSR processes deposit refund in system with reason code (customer cancellation, vendor cannot deliver, project cancelled); (b) system cancels linked Sales Order and triggers Buyer to cancel or reduce the linked PO per W2A PO cancellation process (if PO not yet shipped by vendor); (c) refund issued to original payment method: if deposit paid by cash, CSR disburses from cash drawer with Store Manager authorization; if paid by card/e-wallet, system processes electronic refund (Dr. Customer Deposits Payable / Cr. Cash); if paid by trade account credit, system applies deposit back to customer&#x27;s AR account; (d) system logs refund with customer ID, original deposit transaction, refund amount, refund method, CSR ID, authorizing manager ID, and reason code; (e) BIR-compliant documentation: system generates official receipt for the refund transaction with all required BIR fields (TIN, registered invoice number, description &quot;Refund of customer deposit — Sales Order #[number]&quot;); refund receipts retained per 10-year BIR retention policy
Responsible (R): CSR / Store Manager
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 10 min/refund</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W38_Flow44</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W38_Flow45</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W38_End26" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W38_Flow45</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W38_Annotation27">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-247 (ensure controlled execution — Purchase Order Cycle (PA-03.2).) | - operational: Customer Service Rep (order intake); Buyer (fulfillment) review and approval gate
Owner: Customer Service Rep (order intake); Buyer (fulfillment)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
